<title>USA: Circus Circus possible Hilton target-report.</title>
<headline>Circus Circus possible Hilton target-report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Circus Circus Enterprises Inc could be the target of a takeover attempt by Hilton Hotels Corp, Business Week magazine said.</p>
<p>According to this week's magazine, some unnamed money managers suspect that Hilton, which has not officially withdrawn its hostile bid for ITT Corp, is considering buying Circus Circus.</p>
<p>In the report, an unnamed banker says Circus Circus is worth $30 to $32 a share in a buyout, an offer he says management &quot;wouldn't be unhappy with.&quot;</p>
<p>Circus Circus stock closed Thursday at 23-15/16.</p>
</text>
